# rescan-4 S2 (batch 7y) — pre-commit hook
#
# 1. check-staged-for-secrets: grep-scan staged files for secret-shaped
#    strings (MongoDB URIs with embedded creds, Razorpay key secrets,
#    private-key PEM blocks, etc.). Born from a 2026-06-29 incident where
#    a MongoDB Atlas connection string was found in git history; cleaned
#    up at significant cost (history rewrite + force-push + password
#    rotation + Cloud Run redeploy). This is the first gate so we fail
#    fast before paying the eslint + tsc cost.
#
# 2. lint-staged: runs eslint --fix on the staged .ts/.tsx/.js/.jsx files
#    (configured in package.json#lint-staged). Catches the same warnings
#    CI surfaces, but at commit time, on just the staged surface.
#
# 3. tsc --noEmit: runs the project-wide type check. Cheap (cached) on
#    incremental edits; full pass when the dep graph is cold.
#
# Skipping with --no-verify is supported but discouraged — the same
# checks gate CI, so skipping locally just defers the failure.

bash scripts/check-staged-for-secrets.sh
npx lint-staged
npx tsc --noEmit
